# Copy this file to .env at the repo root and fill in the real value.
# Shared by real-estate-finder (Kakao card/text links) and, indirectly, by
# report-site's .env (which holds the path token embedded in this URL).
# Set after Tailscale Funnel is up: see .docs/RUNBOOK.md.
#KAKAO_REPORT_URL=https://<pc>.<tailnet>.ts.net/report/
